# The Go build cache key hashes this file alongside go.mod and go.sum.
# actions/cache never overwrites an existing key, so a build the Build job in
# test.yaml starts warming reaches the saved cache only under a new key. Bump
# the number below whenever that job warms a build the cache does not yet hold.
# A Go version change needs no bump: go.mod names the version, and a build
# cache written by one Go version is of no use to another.
1
